<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '26px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>回环修正：判定“两簇其实重叠”，再把修正摊回全图</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>10 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不重跑全局 BA：用一次焊接窗口 BA 求出 Sim(3)，再沿主干路径按测地距离插值摊开。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输入</b>　新边让两簇之间突然出现跨簇匹配</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>判定</b>　加权图距 &#62; 10（min_loop_size）且跨簇有效匹配对 &#62; 2</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>做法</b>　两簇各扩 N/2 帧做焊接 BA 得相对变换，深度变化估尺度 → Sim(3)；Dijkstra 找主干</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输出</b>　全图位姿与高斯的同一份 Sim(3) 修正（高斯整棵子树跟着出生帧走）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>关键取值</b>　min_loop_size = 10（加权图距）　·　焊接窗口两簇各扩 N/2 帧</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>论文原文写“跳数 &#62; 5”，按开源代码默认值应为加权图距 &#62; 10</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 580, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Image src="figs/fig6_loop.png" style={{ width: 580, height: 362 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 5 }}>图 6　左：两簇间的加权图距就是回环判据；右：修正沿主干按距离摊开。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '12px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Image src="formula/f10.png" style={{ width: 375.0, height: 30.5 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 3 }}>用“图上的距离”替换“全局优化的解”：牺牲一点精度，把回环代价从“再跑一次全局 BA”降到近似线性。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 40px 12px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>这是全文最值得借鉴的工程取舍——不追求最优解，追求“够用且算得起”。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
